## Findings

- `DesignSettingsScreen` is currently a Compose-only settings UI: `SchoolQuizDesignBackground` wraps a full-size `LazyColumn`, whose content is only `SettingsHeader()` plus `SchoolQuizDesignStyle.entries` options. Evidence: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:48`, `:53`, `:58`, `:63`, `:66`.
- Settings is rendered from the LOCAL tab branch of `AppShellScreen` for `LocalConfig.SettingsRoot`, with `Scaffold` `paddingValues` applied to the screen modifier. Evidence: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:461`, `:462`, `:465`.
- App version data currently flows only as `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME` from app layer into `AppShellScreen` and drawer footer; `VERSION_CODE` exists in Gradle but is not passed through current UI APIs. Evidence: `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:43`, `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:16`, `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:17`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:123`.

## Components

### `DesignSettingsScreen`

- **Location**: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:48`
- **Description**: public composable receives `selectedStyle`, `onStyleSelected`, and `modifier`; it renders design selection UI inside `SchoolQuizDesignBackground`. Evidence: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:48`, `:49`, `:50`, `:51`, `:53`.
- **Uses**: `MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primary`, `SchoolQuizDesignBackground`, `LazyColumn`, `SchoolQuizDesignStyle.entries`, and `DesignStyleOption`. Evidence: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:55`, `:58`, `:66`, `:67`, `:70`.
- **Used by**: `AppShellScreen.LocalTabContent` under `LocalConfig.SettingsRoot`; preview calls it directly. Evidence: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:461`, `:462`; `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:302`.
- **Data flow**: `selectedStyle` controls selected option comparison, and option click calls `onStyleSelected(style)`. Evidence: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:49`, `:72`, `:73`.

### `DesignStyleOption`

- **Location**: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:97`
- **Description**: selectable style card; click handling is attached to the full-width `SchoolQuizDesignCard`. Evidence: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:97`, `:109`, `:112`, `:113`.
- **Uses**: `schoolQuizDesignModeAccent`, `schoolQuizDesignNeutralBorderColor`, `schoolQuizDesignDeepSurfaceColor`, `MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium/bodySmall`. Evidence: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:102`, `:107`, `:115`, `:134`, `:141`.
- **Used by**: `DesignSettingsScreen` lazy `items` block. Evidence: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:66`, `:70`.
- **Data flow**: style title/caption render from private extension properties. Evidence: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:133`, `:140`, `:284`, `:291`.

### `AppShellScreen`

- **Location**: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:121`
- **Description**: root shell composable wires drawer, scaffold, app bars, nav bar, per-tab child content. Evidence: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:99`, `:102`, `:208`, `:227`, `:287`.
- **Uses**: `appVersionName` param from app layer, `DrawerContent`, `LocalTabContent`, `selectedDesignStyle`, `onDesignStyleSelected`. Evidence: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:123`, `:214`, `:220`, `:293`, `:294`.
- **Used by**: `MainActivity.setContent`. Evidence: `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:40`, `:41`.
- **Data flow**: `Scaffold` emits `paddingValues`, passes them to `AppShellContent`, then `LocalTabContent`, then `DesignSettingsScreen` as `Modifier.padding(paddingValues)`. Evidence: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:281`, `:290`, `:341`, `:425`, `:465`.

### `DrawerFooter`

- **Location**: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt:40`
- **Description**: existing drawer footer renders footer actions and a version label. Evidence: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt:31`, `:40`, `:53`, `:55`, `:73`.
- **Uses**: `versionName`, `MaterialTheme.typography.labelSmall`, `MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onBackground.copy(alpha = 0.6f)`, and `clickable(onClick = onVersionTap)`. Evidence: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt:43`, `:74`, `:75`, `:76`, `:79`.
- **Used by**: `DrawerContent`, which receives `versionName` and forwards `onVersionTap`. Evidence: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerContent.kt:31`, `:32`, `:70`, `:73`, `:75`.
- **Data flow**: `AppShellScreen` passes `appVersionName` to `DrawerContent.versionName`, then `DrawerFooter` renders `"v$versionName"`. Evidence: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:220`; `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt:74`.

## Data flow

- `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:16` defines `versionCode = 1`; `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:17` defines `versionName = "0.1.0"`.
- `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:43` passes `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME` into `AppShellScreen.appVersionName`.
- `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:107` documents `appVersionName` as app-layer `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME`; `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:108` documents that library modules cannot access `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME` directly.
- `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:220` forwards `appVersionName` to drawer `versionName`.
- `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt:74` renders drawer version as `v$versionName`.
- `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:461` routes `LocalConfig.SettingsRoot` to `DesignSettingsScreen`.
- `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:463` passes `selectedDesignStyle`; `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:464` passes `onDesignStyleSelected`.
- `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:46` updates selected design style; `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:48` persists it to shared preferences.

