| `DesignSettingsScreen(selectedStyle, onStyleSelected)` | Compose preview | `SchoolQuizTheme` wraps preview and selected style is `SchoolQuizDesignStyle.Clean` | `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:300` |

