| `AppShellScreen.LocalTabContent` | Current `DesignSettingsScreen` call supplies only `selectedStyle`, `onStyleSelected`, and `modifier` | Signature changes require updating this call site | Medium — `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:462` |
| `DesignSettingsScreenPreview` | Current preview call supplies only `selectedStyle` and `onStyleSelected` | Signature changes require updating preview | Low — `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:302` |
| `AppShellScreen` app caller | Current `AppShellScreen` API requires `appVersionName`; no `appVersionCode` param exists | Passing version code to settings requires an API/wiring change at app-shell boundary | Medium — `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:121` |
| `MainActivity` | Current app layer passes only `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME` | `BuildConfig.VERSION_CODE` is available in app Gradle config but not passed to UI | Medium — `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:43`; `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:16` |
| Existing drawer version behavior | Drawer version label is clickable and invokes `onVersionTap` | Settings display-only footer must not accidentally reuse drawer tap behavior if scope remains display-only | Medium — `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt:79` |

