## Constraints / Risks / Open Questions

- Current settings layout is a full-size `LazyColumn` with content padding and spaced items; adding footer as another lazy item would put it in the scroll content path. Evidence: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:58`, `:60`, `:61`, `:63`, `:66`.
- `SchoolQuizDesignBackground` content is a `BoxScope`, so the current background wrapper can host Box-positioned children in addition to the current `LazyColumn`. Evidence: `android/core/designsystem/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/core/designsystem/components/SchoolQuizDesign.kt:170`, `:175`, `:189`, `:199`.
- Settings receives `Scaffold` insets through `Modifier.padding(paddingValues)`, after the top app bar and bottom navigation bar are installed by the shell. Evidence: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:227`, `:250`, `:281`, `:465`.
- Existing settings controls are the style cards; each card is clickable and calls `onStyleSelected(style)`. Evidence: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:70`, `:73`, `:109`, `:113`.
- Existing design style persistence lives in `MainActivity` shared preferences; settings UI only emits `onStyleSelected`. Evidence: `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:33`, `:36`, `:46`, `:48`.
- Existing design-system styling uses `MaterialTheme` color/typography and design tokens; settings currently uses direct `dp` spacing values rather than a spacing token. Evidence: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:60`, `:85`, `:91`, `:120`; `android/core/designsystem/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/core/designsystem/SchoolQuizTheme.kt:35`.
- `SchoolQuizTheme` selects typography by `SchoolQuizDesignStyle`, so footer typography will inherit active design style if it uses `MaterialTheme.typography`. Evidence: `android/core/designsystem/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/core/designsystem/SchoolQuizTheme.kt:39`, `:40`, `:41`.
- `VERSION_CODE` is available from app module configuration, but no current app-shell/settings parameter carries it. Evidence: `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:16`; `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:123`.
- Open question: exact test coverage for settings footer is absent in the local settings module; only `.gitkeep` exists under test/androidTest paths. Evidence: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/test/java/.gitkeep`; `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/androidTest/java/.gitkeep`.

